{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50791","headline":"越州怀古 · 张祜","name":"越州怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"振檝大江东，前林波万顷。\n高秋海天阔，色落湖山影。\n行寻王谢迹，望望登绝岭。\n荒林草木瘦，古树泉石冷。\n昔游不可见，牢落余风景。\n穷愁心未死，一笔聊复秉。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}